{"finding_id": "P06-001", "scene_id": "SC46a2115bf1481b1d", "row_ids": ["CAT:Of24f9a210926a61138ed", "CAT:O8e6665cfd503d0ced752", "CAT:Oc852ffa3ecfea8166aa0"], "severity": "B", "category": "voice", "source_quote": "This is a pretty little elven letter opener, if I do say so myself!\nFeather light, just like how those dresses the elves craft will make you feel.\n...not that I would know anything about those!", "current_quote": "  * 要我自己说，这可是一把精巧的精灵拆信刀！\n  * 轻得像羽毛，就像精灵们缝的那些裙子会让你感觉的那样。\n  * ……那些裙子我一点都不了解！", "proposed_zh": "这把精灵拆信刀可真精巧，我可没夸口！轻得像羽毛，跟穿上精灵做的裙子一样轻飘飘的……当然，那些裙子我可不懂！", "reason": "当前“就像……会让你感觉的那样”照搬从句，末句僵硬否认也削弱说漏嘴后的掩饰；重写整段保留轻盈比较和嘴硬，不认定商人的实际穿衣经历。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#AreaC_MacsenDark.TazerRapier", "datadf/all.ds#L1201", "datadf/all.ds#L1202", "datadf/all.ds#L1203", "D0110c41b79812179ea99", "D4dc1f0f15cbd7e169cd0", "D8e487b45f6e10ee50119"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Macsen"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "AreaC_MacsenDark.TazerRapier", "controls": [{"line": 1200, "source": "<AreaC_MacsenDark.TazerRapier>", "current": "<AreaC_MacsenDark.TazerRapier>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-002", "scene_id": "SC69cf1fb9619b4227", "row_ids": ["CAT:O8988e9c955b5e1662588", "CAT:O24802e5dd74f0347e94f", "CAT:O855a59c5a1c97f9bbd97", "CAT:Ob0c580a571e9cf616874", "CAT:Of3ec5506319e3159db81"], "severity": "B", "category": "gameplay", "source_quote": "MAKE SURE TO SHOW YOUR PETS SOME AFFECTION, AND FEED THEM WELL!\nAFTER YOU'VE MAXXXED OUT AN AFFINITY, RETURN HERE FOR A SPECIAL REWARD.\nWITH THE CRYSTAL, THE CREATURES THAT LOVE YOU CAN GIVE YOU A SPECIAL BOOST!\nJUST PET THEM WHILE THEY'RE AT MAX AFFINITY TO CHARGE THE CRYSTAL.\nEACH CREATURE GIVES A DIFFERENT POWER! TRY THEM ALL!", "current_quote": "    * 一定要给宠物一点关爱，并且好好喂它们！\n    * 在你把一项亲密度MAXXXED到顶之后，回到这儿领一份特殊奖励。\n    * 有了这水晶，爱你的生物就能给你一份特殊加成！\n    * 只要在它们处于MAX亲密度时抚摸它们，就能给水晶充能。\n    * 每种生物给的力量都不同！都试试！", "proposed_zh": "一定要多关爱宠物，也别饿着它们！把任意一只宠物的亲密度提升到最高，再回来领特别奖励。\n有了这块水晶，喜欢你的生物就能给你特殊加成！在亲密度满了以后摸摸它们，就能给水晶充能。每种生物赋予的力量都不一样，都试试吧！", "reason": "MAXXXED与MAX属于可译的程度，不是按键或资源ID；“一项亲密度”未把对象说清。建议分支分别使用对应短段，不把前后两个条件合成同次对话。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#AreaH_MacsenBreeding.Talk.fap", "datadf/all.ds#L1715", "datadf/all.ds#L1716", "datadf/all.ds#L1718", "datadf/all.ds#L1719", "datadf/all.ds#L1720", "D6daf6743ed76564fd044", "Dde860edaecbd3c159a2c", "Dc3e3096df7a91731a56b", "D81800d00613512d2e567", "Daf6e292683fcc45f081e"], "reference_keys": ["world:I05"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "AreaH_MacsenBreeding.Talk.fap", "controls": [{"line": 1713, "source": "<AreaH_MacsenBreeding.Talk.fap>", "current": "<AreaH_MacsenBreeding.Talk.fap>"}, {"line": 1714, "source": "  if { !f(ctx_maxed_any_pet_affinity) } {", "current": "  if { !f(ctx_maxed_any_pet_affinity) } {"}, {"line": 1717, "source": "  } else {", "current": "  } else {"}, {"line": 1721, "source": "  }", "current": "  }"}, {"line": 1723, "source": "### shared ###", "current": "### shared ###"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-003", "scene_id": "SC26dbe5fa7ee9cf03", "row_ids": ["CAT:O6085643e2cb911f52bd9", "CAT:O2ff91ac76b961e33d981", "CAT:O81eaef6035131acf7d2a", "CAT:O80688506ec4fc937df37", "CAT:O329f01983cd242f0b182"], "severity": "B", "category": "idiom", "source_quote": "[BOSSU, ARE THERE CANNONS STRONGER OR AM I WEAKER?]\n[THESE CANNONS SEEM TO HAVE GONE A WHILE WITHOUT]\n[NEEDING TO BE SELF- REPAIRED.]\n[CONSEQUENTLY THEY SEEM TO BE FIRING AT HIGHER POWER.]\n[GREEAAAAAT, JUST WHAT I NEEDED TO DEAL WITH...]", "current_quote": "  Yiffany: [波苏，是有更强的加农炮，还是我变弱了？]\n  Bossu: [这些加农炮似乎已经有一段时间不需要自行修复了。]\n\n  Bossu: [因此它们似乎正以更高的功率发射。]\n  Yiffany: [太——好了，正好是我需要应付的……]", "proposed_zh": "伊法妮：[波苏，是这里的炮变强了，还是我变弱了？]\n波苏：[这些炮似乎已经有一阵子不用自我修复了，所以开火的威力也更大。]\n伊法妮：[太——好了，还嫌麻烦不够多是吧……]", "reason": "首问there疑为their源拼写异常，但中文可据后续these还原此处炮台比较；末句just what I needed是反讽抱怨，当前“正好是我需要应付的”落点生硬。建议保留seem，不加具体修复耗能机理。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#BossuDex.ClassicCannonWallC", "datadf/all.ds#L3187", "datadf/all.ds#L3188", "datadf/all.ds#L3189", "datadf/all.ds#L3190", "datadf/all.ds#L3191", "D2a4fe8565f6793bc65ec", "Dd867d5baf899fa43c5c8", "D0bb75b7996c4aa9c8f0e", "D06457645af3cca345e89", "Ddd029575a5acb7df94b2"], "reference_keys": ["world:D01"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "BossuDex.ClassicCannonWallC", "controls": [{"line": 3186, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonWallC>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicCannonWallC>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
