{"finding_id": "P06-005", "scene_id": "SCcbbefc7a63e6bd3c", "row_ids": ["CAT:O07de952874c8567ec67e", "CAT:Of590992955d0fe782b50", "CAT:Oe58ce2f31ad70bbfb297", "CAT:O3e2a6e069e410f66444e", "CAT:O86b07077dd5ef649ab48", "CAT:Ob83e80b143bd0c54587f", "CAT:O8b488727c1bc9785c678"], "severity": "B", "category": "continuity", "source_quote": "[WHAT DO YOU MEAN?]\n[WELL, NOT TO ALARM YOU... BUT...]\n[THERE SEEMS TO BE ANOTHER AGENT IN THE AREA.]\n[AND THEY'VE BEEN MOVING ABOUT. FREELY.]\n[ANOTHER AGENT...]\n[WE'RE STILL TRYING TO HAIL THEM, BUT... WELL...]\n[NOW IT LOOKS LIKE THEIR RADIO HAS BEEN TURNED OFF.]", "current_quote": "  Yiffany: [你什么意思？]\n  Mauser: [嗯，不是要吓你……但是……]\n  Bossu: [这片区域里似乎还有另一名特工。]\n  Bossu: [而且他们一直在四处移动。自由地。]\n  Yiffany: [另一名特工……]\n  Mauser: [我们仍在尝试呼叫他们，但是……嗯……]\n  Mauser: [而现在看来他们的无线电已经被关掉了。]", "proposed_zh": "伊法妮：[什么异常？]\n毛瑟：[这个，不是想吓你……不过……]\n波苏：[这片区域似乎还有一名特工，而且一直在四处活动。行动完全不受限制。]\n伊法妮：[另一名特工……]\n毛瑟：[我们还在试着呼叫对方，可是……嗯……现在看起来，对方的无线电已经关了。]", "reason": "单一未知agent被反复译“他们”，且“自由地”孤立作补语不自然；核心是其他探员被捕时这位却能自由行动。改“对方”避免提前确定身份、性别和关机主体；末句也可保守译“对方的无线电已经关了”。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#Mauser.AreaC_map64_a noselect", "datadf/all.ds#L2411", "datadf/all.ds#L2412", "datadf/all.ds#L2413", "datadf/all.ds#L2414", "datadf/all.ds#L2415", "datadf/all.ds#L2416", "datadf/all.ds#L2417", "Db3d9f5c94aa2355a423c", "Ddea7f867303ba0bec8f6", "De437ae290cd04141701c", "D83fb1edf654b5a2626b9", "D8e82ca037f2bc3ac52d5", "Dbb8938476f31d37c09b5", "D33bcefe6915f13e51879"], "reference_keys": ["characters-primary:揭示门槛"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "Mauser.AreaC_map64_a noselect", "controls": [{"line": 2407, "source": "<Mauser.AreaC_map64_a noselect>", "current": "<Mauser.AreaC_map64_a noselect>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
