{"finding_id": "P06-008", "scene_id": "SCa95fc07f154b4282", "row_ids": ["SFW73278dff7c93fd2eb47620ec", "SFW7af2be641cc852e5821d0598", "SFW8421c222b3946fc833591068", "SFW43666f97e4b7ec27b2ed407e"], "severity": "A", "category": "term", "source_quote": "[DID THAT GRRRL REALLY GET BEATEN UP BY SOME KOBOS]\n[AND LOSE HER RADIO... YET AGAIN...]\n[...?!]\n[HOPE SHE FINDS IT AGAIN ONCE SHE COMES AROUND, SERIOUSLY]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [那姑娘真被几只狗头人打败了，]\n  Tomcat: [又把收音机弄丢了……又一次……]\n  Yiffany: [……？！]\n  Tomcat: [说真的，希望她醒过来之后能再找到它。]", "proposed_zh": "[那姑娘不会又被几个狗头人打倒，把无线电弄丢了吧……又来一次……]\n[……？！]\n[说真的，希望她醒来后还能把它找回来。]", "reason": "当前“收音机”把可双向联络的任务radio说成单向收音设备；此处Tomcat误以为Kobo捡走通讯器。保留误认，不将台词改成已认出主角。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq", "datadf/all.ds#Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq:3737", "datadf/all.ds#Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq:3738", "datadf/all.ds#Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq:3739", "datadf/all.ds#Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq:3740"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Tomcat"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "sfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq", "controls": [{"line": 3735, "source": "<Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq>", "current": "<Tomcat.KoboPickup noselect noamendfreq>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-009", "scene_id": "SCf17f3e7ace13c492", "row_ids": ["CAT:O568359b36c79daa60a0b", "CAT:O24109df10e74505b50de", "CAT:Obd59153df257ac321a56"], "severity": "A", "category": "source_uncertainty", "source_quote": "[IN ORDER TO USE A KEYCARD, ALL YOU HAVE TO DO IS]\n[WALK INTO AN ENERGY DOOR WHILE HOLDING ONE.]\n[YOU CAN OPEN DOORS UP TO THE LEVEL DISPLAYED ON THEM!]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [要用门卡的话，你只要拿着一张走进能量门就行。]\n\n  Tomcat: [你能打开等级不超过门上所标数字的门！]", "proposed_zh": null, "reason": "本行源文them可指keycards或doors，字面“门上所标等级以内的门”成为自指，当前照译后无法说明门卡权限。本包同女线SpecialKeycard1已说明门终端是最低需求且高卡兼开低门。须核4级卡实际触发/显示对象，若them指卡建议“拿着门卡走进能量门就能开门；门的等级不超过门卡等级就行。”不能在本轮直接覆写源歧义。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard4", "datadf/all.ds#L4314", "datadf/all.ds#L4315", "datadf/all.ds#L4316", "Dff0d1cac41ee15adadfc", "D4cd4cf848f2a3b3309b9", "Da3032095d96a2d715469"], "reference_keys": ["world:I04"], "status": "needs_evidence", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard4", "controls": [{"line": 4313, "source": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard4>", "current": "<TomcatItems.SpecialKeycard4>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-010", "scene_id": "SCa84ca531944c6858", "row_ids": ["SFW26e5f4cab637454f86d039bb", "SFW468ac7de16832e79dae71638"], "severity": "B", "category": "term", "source_quote": "[WELL. THAT ONE DEFINITELY WOULDN'T PASS SPEC IN ANY]\n[SYSTEM IN THIS QUADRANT. USEFUL IN A PINCH, THOUGH.]", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: [嗯。这把在这个象限的任何系统里都绝对过不了规格。不过应急倒能用。]\n", "proposed_zh": "[嗯，这把东西在这个象限的任何星系都过不了规格检验。不过应急倒是能用。]", "reason": "system为星系/辖属地域而非电脑系统，pass spec是符合规格；“任何系统里过不了规格”失去科技装备说明的自然表达。保留口语评估，不额外宣称具体违法条款。", "evidence_refs": ["datadf/all.ds#TomcatItems.TazerPirate", "datadf/all.ds#TomcatItems.TazerPirate:4061", "datadf/all.ds#TomcatItems.TazerPirate:4062", "D3d942eab1c4aed019e47", "D8bcf9cc6dbd880a80927"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Tomcat"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "sfw", "logical_path": "datadf/all.ds", "root": "TomcatItems.TazerPirate", "controls": [{"line": 4059, "source": "<TomcatItems.TazerPirate>", "current": "<TomcatItems.TazerPirate>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-011", "scene_id": "SC17d46a70f789c0a9", "row_ids": ["CAT:O5b01695aa91e9065af63", "CAT:O62ab8003942a693c9bd7"], "severity": "A", "category": "term", "source_quote": "If you find a radio out there, remember:\nPress SELECT in the item menu to use your radio!", "current_quote": "  * 要是在外面找到收音机，记住：在物品菜单里按SELECT就能使用收音机！\n", "proposed_zh": "要是在外头找到无线电，记住：在物品菜单里按SELECT，就能用它联络！", "reason": "有SELECT使用提示且进入通讯系统，当前“收音机”错误限定为广播接收机；SELECT保留，不改按键。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#Area0_Macsen1.Talk.hornets", "datadm/all.ds#L67", "datadm/all.ds#L68", "Dcc2c10d342077b3c23d4", "D26ceeeb08c7ab8af4503"], "reference_keys": ["world:I10"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "Area0_Macsen1.Talk.hornets", "controls": [{"line": 66, "source": "<Area0_Macsen1.Talk.hornets>", "current": "<Area0_Macsen1.Talk.hornets>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-012", "scene_id": "SC1d927b426a0e5fa4", "row_ids": ["CAT:Od00964fe255c6771c86e", "CAT:O61d2b4824b8b3c980cfb", "CAT:O5dce2318c05ef968ed05", "CAT:O89b96c25e307c5fe326d", "CAT:Oa6d11b8a0dc25131cbc4", "CAT:Of735a180f72f63093247", "CAT:O830094b1449b8213c1e4", "CAT:O4e066a473c3e2b9aef8e", "CAT:Ob31df43cd88f8778dff1"], "severity": "B", "category": "voice", "source_quote": "[H-HEY! I JUST DON'T KNOW MY OWN STRENGTH!]\n[DON'T GET CAUGHT UP IN THE HEAT OF THE MOMENT]\n[PRIORITIZE DATA COLLECTION IN YOUR NEXT ENCOUNTER.]\n[UNDERSTOOD, BOSSU! I WON'T LET YOU DOWN.]\n[GOOD BOY, LOOKING FORWARD TO SEEING THAT DATA!]\n[IF YOU COME ACROSS ANY NEW CREATURES, FEEL FREE TO]\n[GIVE ME A CALL AT FREQUENCY 27.850.]\n[OH AND DON'T FORGET TO EQUIP YOUR NEW GEAR. OVER!]\n[GEEZE I KNOW THAT, I AIN'T NO PUP...]", "current_quote": "  Yiffai: [嘿-嘿！我就是不知道自己的力气有多大！]\n  Bossu: [别被一时的热劲卷住]\n  Bossu: [下次遭遇时优先做数据采集。]\n  Yiffai: [明白，Bossu！我不会让你失望。]\n  Bossu: [好男孩，期待看到那份数据！]\n  Bossu: [如果你碰上任何新生物，尽管用频率27.850呼叫我。]\n\n  Bossu: [哦，还有，别忘了把新装备装上。完毕！]\n  Yiffai: [哎呀我知道，我才不是Pup...]", "proposed_zh": "伊法伊：[喂、喂！我只是一时没掌握好力道！]\n波苏：[别一打上头就忘了正事。下次遇到生物，优先采集数据。]\n伊法伊：[明白，波苏！不会让你失望的。]\n波苏：[好小子，等着看你的数据！再碰到新生物，就用27.850呼叫我。还有，别忘了把新装备装上。完毕！]\n伊法伊：[知道啦，我又不是小狗崽……]", "reason": "H-HEY是急辩口吃，不是“嘿嘿”笑声；heat of moment是上头冲动，不是“热劲卷住”；末尾Pup未译使嘴硬回应失去落点。全段建议保持各人和频率节点，不按段落平均回填。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#Bossu.Area0_map10_a noselect noamendfreq", "datadm/all.ds#L2011", "datadm/all.ds#L2012", "datadm/all.ds#L2013", "datadm/all.ds#L2014", "datadm/all.ds#L2015", "datadm/all.ds#L2016", "datadm/all.ds#L2017", "datadm/all.ds#L2018", "datadm/all.ds#L2019", "D38a7b6f632d3d4920fba", "Dd18fc511fcf1366f3eb0", "D9479f7cd1322ede97f0f", "D09dce01cbf1bccb85bb0", "Dcfc4c0faaedc6be3a295", "D0d8e560dc45b18339684", "D58d49a2b312ab2ee41d8", "D3b537a0c7c2970289ceb", "D2793fac7cef4c23c459c"], "reference_keys": ["characters-primary:Yiffai", "characters-support:Bossu"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "Bossu.Area0_map10_a noselect noamendfreq", "controls": [{"line": 2006, "source": "<Bossu.Area0_map10_a noselect noamendfreq>", "current": "<Bossu.Area0_map10_a noselect noamendfreq>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-013", "scene_id": "SC8a64100509cd1232", "row_ids": ["CAT:Oa299621be2e312a2d893", "CAT:O9c1a9aa8e10289020dfc", "CAT:O82887b0dca5cb11914c2", "CAT:O31be82e0e4a06e00e94d", "CAT:O304cc576325be34a1edd", "CAT:Ob0b3a83a351d58834c4b"], "severity": "A", "category": "meaning", "source_quote": "[THE ELVES OF SCEAFYA MAY ALL BE FEMALE]\n[BUT THEY AREN'T ALL IMMORTAL.]\n[AS THEY CAN BREED WITH ANY MALE OF ANY SPECIES]\n[THEY'VE TAKEN ON MORE AND MORE MORTAL CHARACTERISTICS]\n[WAIT, SO THAT MEANS SOME OF THEM *ARE* IMMORTAL?]\n[INDEED, AS FAR AS WE CAN TELL.]", "current_quote": "  Bossu: [斯凯菲亚的精灵也许全是雌性，但她们并不全是不朽的。]\n\n  Bossu: [由于她们能与任何物种的任何雄性繁殖，她们便带上了越来越多的有朽特征。]\n\n  Yiffai: [等等，所以这意味着她们中有些*是*不朽的？]\n  Bossu: [的确，就我们所能看出的而言。]", "proposed_zh": "波苏：[斯凯菲亚的精灵虽说全是女性，却并不个个长生不老。她们能与任何物种的雄性繁衍，因此逐渐带上了更多凡俗生物的特征。]\n伊法伊：[等等，也就是说，她们之中真有长生不老的？]\n波苏：[没错，至少我们目前掌握的资料是这样。]", "reason": "may all be female在may...but结构作让步，不是独立不确定“也许全是雌性”；当前把让步误作概率。“有朽特征”“所能看出的而言”不自然。结论仍归Bossu资料，不宣称世界全知真理。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#BossuDex.ClassicElf", "datadm/all.ds#L3264", "datadm/all.ds#L3265", "datadm/all.ds#L3266", "datadm/all.ds#L3267", "datadm/all.ds#L3268", "datadm/all.ds#L3269", "D5b2a0ded65b05a8c4a4b", "Ded16272bce4c9ad0e0e8", "Dcc16f1c80cba3b29825c", "D988644c7b29b57f29170", "D37a2af6fea5d2ff4e91d", "D14d1fe20a325ee566503"], "reference_keys": ["world:D04"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "BossuDex.ClassicElf", "controls": [{"line": 3263, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicElf>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicElf>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-014", "scene_id": "SC8a64100509cd1232", "row_ids": ["CAT:Oe38b2b70784cc3df5a55", "CAT:O7005f10b43f2f4051064", "CAT:O976d2e35aa12aa3e3ee6"], "severity": "B", "category": "idiom", "source_quote": "[DON'T GIVE IN TO AWE. YOU'LL NEED TO BE ON YOUR TOES]\n[IN ORDER TO REPEL THE YOUNG ELVES' ATTACKS.]\n[RIGHT, GOTTA FOCUS.]", "current_quote": "  Bossu: [别向敬畏屈服。你得保持警觉，以便击退那些年幼精灵的攻击。]\n\n  Yiffai: [对，得专注。]", "proposed_zh": "波苏：[别光顾着惊叹。打起精神，才能挡住那些年轻精灵的攻击。]\n伊法伊：[对，得专心。]", "reason": "give in to awe在此是制止看呆、提醒战斗，当前“别向敬畏屈服”语域与上下句不接。保留警觉与防御目的，不增加侮辱或敌意。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#BossuDex.ClassicElf", "datadm/all.ds#L3273", "datadm/all.ds#L3274", "datadm/all.ds#L3275", "D675d1eadf501e2fb62a2", "D4b00b09e203eaed7cf90", "D19a92a0d298c43889bd7"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Bossu"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "BossuDex.ClassicElf", "controls": [{"line": 3263, "source": "<BossuDex.ClassicElf>", "current": "<BossuDex.ClassicElf>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-015", "scene_id": "SC12557c972d930ead", "row_ids": ["CAT:O7cf6920b6d6e44368d47", "CAT:Oe159343ea8b60fff8a8a"], "severity": "A", "category": "voice", "source_quote": "DARN, YOUR HEALTH JUST DROPPED\nYOU THINK YOU CAN GET UP?", "current_quote": "  Tomcat: 可恶，你的生命值掉下来了\n  Tomcat: 你以为你还能站起来吗？", "proposed_zh": "[糟了，你的生命值掉下去了。你还能站起来吗？]", "reason": "关切伤情、询问是否能起身，被译“你以为你还能站起来吗”成威胁或嘲讽；同场后续Bossu提供战术提示，明确是支援语境。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#DefeatHints.ClassicWerehund.transform", "datadm/all.ds#L4864", "datadm/all.ds#L4865", "D1f73f6380da1780f8bd0", "D3b7d4d9c01ecee166e26"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Tomcat"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "DefeatHints.ClassicWerehund.transform", "controls": [{"line": 4863, "source": "<DefeatHints.ClassicWerehund.transform>", "current": "<DefeatHints.ClassicWerehund.transform>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-016", "scene_id": "SC2c035a06b63b51a3", "row_ids": ["CAT:O9353b7f70cf5c0ae23cc", "CAT:Oe34e4dc85c04e7f74f68", "CAT:Oc22baa07ce223597822d"], "severity": "B", "category": "voice", "source_quote": "[PLENTY OF FOODS OUT THERE WILL HEAL YOU A BIT]\n[AND SOME WILL EVEN RAISE YOUR STATS!]\n[STOCK UP IF SOME BEAST IS GIVING YOU A HARD TIME.]", "current_quote": "    Gitgud: [外面有不少食物能治疗你一点，有些甚至会提升你的属性！]\n\n    Gitgud: [如果某只野兽让你吃不消，就多囤一些。]", "proposed_zh": "[外头不少食物都能帮你回点血，有些还能提升属性！要是有哪只野兽打不过，就多备点吃的。]", "reason": "“治疗你一点”是英语宾语结构硬搬；教程需自然说明恢复与备粮，不把吃不消扩大为强制购买。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#Gitgud.Tip6", "datadm/all.ds#L3388", "datadm/all.ds#L3389", "datadm/all.ds#L3390", "D7349c232c82d8856e589", "D28416e56b874d8937945", "De10fa05f8f7d8a73d926"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:Gitgud"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "Gitgud.Tip6", "controls": [{"line": 3387, "source": "<Gitgud.Tip6>", "current": "<Gitgud.Tip6>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-017", "scene_id": "SCd14e021c6ca16c23", "row_ids": ["CAT:O52909c720e43010faa0b", "CAT:O90af7e4a58483015f82f", "CAT:Oa61a078198bc4a8bf661", "CAT:Oe84a9ddc8afbed7d9c71"], "severity": "B", "category": "voice", "source_quote": "Greetings, Yiffai. You don't know me, but I kinda snooped your satlink.\nSo I've actually been watching you for a while, and I have a proposition...\nIt's simple: You bring me those fancy chips you find out there,\nand I'll hack open doors for you! It's a win-win, obviously!", "current_quote": "  * 你好，伊法伊。你不认识我，不过我有点偷看了你的卫星链路。\n  * 所以其实我已经观察你有一阵子了，我有个提议……\n  * 很简单：你把在外头找到的那些花哨芯片带给我，我就替你黑开门！显然，这是双赢！\n", "proposed_zh": "你好，伊法伊。你不认识我，不过我偷偷接入了你的卫星链路。其实我已经留意你一阵子了，想跟你谈笔交易……\n很简单：把你在外头找到的那些高级芯片带给我，我就替你破解门锁！这不是双赢嘛！", "reason": "“有点偷看了”逐词追随kinda，中文搭配不成立；snoop satlink对应私自接入/窥探通讯，不是目视查看链路。按共享黑客身份范围，不扩认所有测试黑客为The0。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#Hacker_Shared.Meeting", "datadm/all.ds#L4970", "datadm/all.ds#L4971", "datadm/all.ds#L4972", "datadm/all.ds#L4973", "D37a04fec0436ce935a22", "D497a68a9b227040e307f", "D0ddacd5616cd73308110", "D5a267d3fe5082a86d8b7"], "reference_keys": ["characters-support:The0"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "Hacker_Shared.Meeting", "controls": [{"line": 4969, "source": "<Hacker_Shared.Meeting>", "current": "<Hacker_Shared.Meeting>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-018", "scene_id": "SC5952f8f6e6829e90", "row_ids": ["SFWecf9e33c519b2bdba500660f"], "severity": "A", "category": "meaning", "source_quote": "[I RAN INTO THIS GLOWING ORB AND IT LEFT A MARK ON ME.]", "current_quote": "  Yiffai: [我碰到个球体，它在我身上留了个印记。]", "proposed_zh": "[我碰到一个发光的球体，它在我身上留下了个印记。]", "reason": "glowing明确可观察特征，当前丢失“发光”；该特征承接识别古代科技的后文，不宜删。", "evidence_refs": ["datadm/all.ds#TomcatItems.SpecialLeftmark", "datadm/all.ds#TomcatItems.SpecialLeftmark:4214", "Dc42b0405143b2e68c88e"], "reference_keys": ["world:I06"], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "sfw", "logical_path": "datadm/all.ds", "root": "TomcatItems.SpecialLeftmark", "controls": [{"line": 4211, "source": "<TomcatItems.SpecialLeftmark>", "current": "<TomcatItems.SpecialLeftmark>"}]}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
{"finding_id": "P06-019", "scene_id": "SC91728abf50d61496", "row_ids": ["CAT:O3dc237c9c664f79fca52"], "severity": "B", "category": "idiom", "source_quote": "THE SWIPER PURRS POLITELY,|SHEATHING HIS MURDER MITTENS|AT YOUR APPROACH.", "current_quote": "挥爪礼貌地呼噜，|在你走近时收起|他的凶器肉垫。", "proposed_zh": "挥爪轻轻打着呼噜，|你一走近，便乖乖|收起了那双利爪。", "reason": "murder mittens是对猫爪的幽默称法，sheathe为收爪；当前“收起凶器肉垫”像把肉垫收进身体。保留礼貌地收敛威胁的亲密度变化，不把整组状态合成一次动作。", "evidence_refs": ["datav/dictionary.json#ui.breeding.Swiper.affinity", "datav/dictionary.json#ui.breeding.Swiper.affinity.high", "U083416b25fba95865c55"], "reference_keys": [], "status": "proposal", "apply_scope": "scene_draft_only", "branch": {"mode": "nsfw", "logical_path": "datav/dictionary.json", "root": "ui.breeding.Swiper.affinity", "controls": []}, "alias_scope": "仅本场景；别名来源保持原映射，不扩展到内容或控制不同的场景"}
